OL,3,AYellow warnings remain in force as rain
OL,4,Aand thunderstorms hit parts of UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FDownpours and thunderstorms will
OL,7,Fcontinue to bring the risk of flooding
OL,8,Fto parts of the UK on Wednesday.
OL,10,FA Met Office yellow warning for
OL,11,Fthunderstorms is valid until 22:00 BST,
OL,12,Fand was amended on Wednesday morning to
OL,13,Fcover northern and eastern Wales, as
OL,14,Fwell as north-west England, the
OL,15,FMidlands and parts of eastern and
OL,16,Fsouthern England.
OL,18,FThe rain could be heavy enough to bring
OL,19,Fflash flooding and travel disruption,
OL,20,Fwith lightning and large hail posing
OL,21,Fadditional hazards.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
